<body>
    <header class="navbar-default" role="banner">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="navbar-header">
                <button class="navbar-toggle" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target=".bs-navbar-collapse"><span class="sr-only">Click</span> <span class="icon-bar"></span><span class="icon-bar"></span><span class="icon-bar"></span></button>
                <a href="http://upan.oureda.cn/" class="navbar-brand"><i class="glyphicon-cloud glyphicon" style="font-size: 24px;"></i>OurEDA</a>
            </div>
            <nav class="collapse navbar-collapse bs-navbar-collapse" role="navigation">
                <ul class="nav navbar-nav navbar-right">
                    <li><a href="http://upan.oureda.cn/">首页</a> </li>
                    <li><a href="~/Home/Introduce">相关介绍</a> </li>
                    <li><a href="~/Home/Question">常见问题</a> </li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="ad">
            <img src="~/image/logo.gif" style="float: left; margin-right: 5%;">
            <div class="adword">
                <p style="font-size: 22px;">忘带U盘？怕中木马？互传文件传的好慢？</p>
                <p style="font-size: 20px;">随时上传，随地下载，短短四位，用提取码下载文件</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="miniad">
            <p style="font-size: 1.5em;">忘带U盘？怕中木马？</p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.5em;">互传文件传的好慢？</p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.25em;">快来用微云盘！</p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.25em;">随时上传，随地下载，短短四位，用提取码下载文件</p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.25em;">移动版和平板电脑不支持哦，快快换成电脑吧！</p>
        </div>


        <div class="center" id="uploader">

            <div class="btns">
                <a id="pp">
                    <div id="picker">选择文件</div>
                </a>
            </div>

            <div id="thelist" class="uploader-list"></div>





            <div class="suggest">
                <p id="dword">*直接用鼠标把文件拖进这个框里也能上传哦 *</p>
                <div>
                    <span id="temp"></span><a name="xn_share" onclick="shareClick()" type="button_large" href="javascript:;" style="display: none;" id="srenren"></a>
                </div>
                <p id="remember"></p>
                <p id="warning"></p>
            </div>
            <div class="downword">
                <a href="~/Home/Fdownload"><span>去下载<i class="glyphicon glyphicon-hand-right"></i></span></a>
            </div>
            <div class="erwei">
                <a data-toggle="modal" data-target="#myModal" style="cursor:pointer;" id="erweixiazai"><i class="glyphicon glyphicon-hand-left"></i><span> Orz跪求点一下</span></a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Modal -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="myModal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="myModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog">
            <div class="modal-content">
                <div class="modal-header">
                    <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-hidden="true">&times;</button>
                    <h4 class="modal-title" id="myModalLabel" style="color: #000;">感谢大家对微云盘长时间的支持！</h4>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body" style="text-align:left;text-indent:2em;color:#000;">
                    <p>我们（大连理工大学OurEDA团队）在参加2014年移动互联网创新创业大赛，我们的作品是 “微信控制智能家居”。希望大家能够继续支持我们，为我们投出你宝贵的一票。</p>
                    <p>【第一步，微信添加朋友搜索“T派”，或者扫描二维码也行，关注它。】</p>
                    <img style="margin-left:212px;" src="~/image/weixin.jpg" />
                    <p>【第二步：发送消息“vote 4448” 给它，就行了！】</p>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal">OurEDA最厉害啦！</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- /.modal-content -->
        </div>
        <!-- /.modal-dialog -->
    </div>
    <!-- /.modal -->
